calculations MUST NOT be shown. A legacy review MUST NOT invent an assessment.
The assessment MUST be marked Experimental and hidden when disabled, including saved
results and generated posting text. Source: Tavi's 21 Oct 2026 merge-risk request and
follow-up requiring experimental, opt-in-only features, replacing unconditional display.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;design] shared-ai-code-retains-the-diff-well
